| tips = *Using during a well timed jump can result it being low enough for enemies to target, such as Infested or Melee units, but be more protected from most melee attacks. (Ancients will still be able to reach, as well as the knockback damage from Leapers).
*Place Molt in locations which can protect it from enemy attacks to maximize its survival.
*{{WF|Limbo}} can utilize this ability by casting {{A|Banish}} on the decoy, granting it immunity to all attacks that do not affect targets in the [[Rift Plane]].
*If Molt is closer to the enemy than the player, enemies will (normally) focus it. Applies to the caster as well as other players, unless they're using aggro-increasing abilities such as {{WF|Nyx}}'s {{A|Absorb}} or {{WF|Rhino}}'s {{A|Iron Skin}}.
*It can be used as protection from enemy fire, when you revive an downed teammate.
